shedAt":"2026-08-19T06:16:46.000Z","createdAt":"2026-08-22T18:43:28.578Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-22T18:43:28.578Z"},{"platformId":"7675296699229602591","profilePlatformId":"6741445775487730694","profileHandle":"maddiecastellano","content":"Get out this looks amazing","likesCount":0,"repliesCount":0,"publishedAt":"2026-08-18T09:12:08.000Z","createdAt":"2026-08-22T18:43:28.578Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-22T18:43:28.578Z"},{"platformId":"7671352748558566157","profilePlatformId":"7053006142976689158","profileHandle":"thestylistx21","content":"@Jordan_The_Stallion8 @Keith Lee","likesCount":0,"repliesCount":0,"publishedAt":"2026-08-07T18:07:17.000Z","createdAt":"2026-08-22T18:43:28.578Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-22T18:43:28.578Z"},{"platformId":"7668589871259566861","profilePlatformId":"7003574217040315398","profileHandle":"missmiavi","content":"I need","likesCount":0,"repliesCount":0,"publishedAt":"2026-07-31T07:26:34.000Z","createdAt":"2026-08-22T18:43:28.578Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-22T18:43:28.578Z"},{"platformId":"7668589935489712909","profilePlatformId":"7003574217040315398","profileHandle":"missmiavi","content":"LOOKS SOOOOO GOOD","likesCount":0,"repliesCount":0,"publishedAt":"2026-07-31T07:26:32.000Z","createdAt":"2026-08-22T18:43:28.578Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-22T18:43:28.578Z"}],"createdAt":"2026-08-21T20:18:29.666Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-25T08:44:23.569Z"},{"id":"cnt_be679c0719cc46ce6f66bfb6b56b","matchedQueries":[],"platform":"instagram","profileHandle":"iluvsarahii","profileDisplayName":"Karen Sarahi Robles","format":"video","caption":"Week5: What’s crazier… running 15 miles in this heat or running 15 miles on a treadmill? \n\nFirst time ever sharing a run this long on the treadmill and let me tell you… the mental battle is REAL lol But sometimes you just have to adapt.\n\nSummer tip: if you can get your long runs done early before the heat takes over unless you want to become best friends with the tready 😂\n\nAlso, I got microneedling this week, so staying out of the sun was non-negotiable.\n\nWearing:\n@fpmovement top\n@CSB crossover shorts\n@newbalance Fresh Foam X 1080\n@onepeloton Tread+\n@whoop life + aqua band \n@garmin forerunner 570\n\n#marathontraining #treadmillrun #runnergirl","captionLanguage":"en","thumbnailMediaId":"med_51f46c22fdfc2a54909ce6570d73","publishedAt":"2026-07-19T23:45:15.000Z","profileId":"prf_76398f20bc7a50dbd7783ebac775","thumbnailMediaUrl":"https://oriane-contents.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/Da_kQsfPOCG/thumbnail.webp","viewsCount":427463,"likesCount":12241,"sharesCount":569,"commentsCount":233,"interactionsCount":13043,"engagementRatePerViews":3.0512582375550634,"engagementRatePerFollowers":0.2046129931054693,"profileFollowersCount":6374473,"profileFollowingCount":4381,"profilePostsCount":4405,"mediaCount":1,"duration":138.412,"hashtags":["#marathontraining","#treadmillrun","#runnergirl"],"coAuthors":[],"mentions":[{"id":null,"platformId":null,"profileHandle":"garmin"},{"id":"prf_140bf7f6363411b3aca431382d0b","platformId":"387295631","profileHandle":"onepeloton"},{"id":"prf_3c5862ac240dee2b1162b3f6ea44","platformId":"1431248158","profileHandle":"whoop"},{"id":"prf_97f67d89aef535ae8b477baa3937","platformId":"12299898652","profileHandle":"csb"},{"id":"prf_cbfbd73f42420af387803d407c51","platformId":"2284539964","profileHandle":"fpmovement"},{"id":"prf_98cba718df4bca7328768b5dd12c","platformId":"204654945","profileHandle":"newbalance"}],"platformId":"Da_kQsfPOCG","profilePlatformId":"174786446","profilePictureUrl":"https://oriane-handles.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/iluvsarahii/pfp.webp","profileBio":"Beauty • Running • Life\nFounder @lybrelashes \niluvsarahii@revel-mgmt.com","profileVerified":true,"locationPlatformId":null,"locationCompleteAddress":null,"locationLatitude":null,"locationLongitude":null,"profileLocationPlatformId":null,"profileLocationCompleteAddress":null,"profileLocationLatitude":null,"profileLocationLongitude":null,"transcript":"I know this probably sounds crazy, but come with me to go run 15 miles on the treadmill. I know. But running the heat is a little crazier to me and I just got my cronadling done so it can't be in the sun anyways. So I'm doing it on the treadmill and we're gonna have a good time. For today's long run, I'm gonna be using the 1080 sneakers from New Balance. These have actually been really, really nice for those long runs. They're very light, very comfortable. I have tested them both indoors and outdoors. And these do really good for this. Like again, comfy pace, computational pace. These are great. The hardest part is just starting and then the even harder part is getting to that first mile. But once you get there, it's so much easier. Take it one mile at a time. Distract yourself because it is truly all mental. Your mind will tell you to stop before your legs do. Just remember that. Here we go. 15 miles. 3, 2, 1, let's go. So in this first mile, I'm taking this as my warm up. Going at a real chill pace. I have a long way to go so there is no need to rush these miles. Right now I'm just taking it nice and easy. As you guys can see, I'm talking to you. One down, 14 to go. I have 3.907. Just hit my 0.4 and I'm now at an 82 side pace. About to hit my first gel. They're not good. I don't like them. I don't want them. But I have to take them. I have to take them. I have to take them. I have to take them. I have to take them. I have to take them. I have to take them. I have to take them. I have to take them. I have to take them. I have to take them. I have to take them. I have to take them. I have to take them. I have to take them. I have to take them. I have to take them. I have to take them. I have to take them. I have to take them. I have to take them. I have to take them. I have to take them. I have to take them. I have to take them. I have to take them. I have to take them. I have to take them. Mile 5. Mile 6, 845. Mile 7. Mile 8. And we're joining the peloton. I'm tossing out. Mile 10, 810. Mile 11, 854. Mile 12. Line 13, 836. Line 15, 815. Woo! That's a wrap on 15 miles. Do not forget to stretch, drink your electrolyte fuel up with food, and enjoy your day.","transcriptLanguage":"en","transcriptChunks":[{"startSeconds":0.006,"endSeconds":4.287,"text":"I know this probably sounds crazy, but come with me to go run 15 miles on the treadmill."},{"startSeconds":4.287,"endSeconds":5.287,"text":"I know."},{"startSeconds":5.287,"endSeconds":8.887,"text":"But running the heat is a little crazier to me and I just got my cronadling done so it"},{"startSeconds":8.887,"endSeconds":10.567,"text":"can't be in the sun anyways."},{"startSeconds":10.567,"endSeconds":13.227,"text":"So I'm doing it on the treadmill and we're gonna have a good time."},{"startSeconds":13.227,"endSeconds":17.247,"text":"For today's long run, I'm gonna be using the 1080 sneakers from New Balance."},{"startSeconds":17.247,"endSeconds":20.066,"text":"These have actually been really, really nice for those long runs."},{"startSeconds":20.066,"endSeconds":21.247,"text":"They're very light, very comfortable."},{"startSeconds":21.247,"endSeconds":23.447,"text":"I have tested them both indoors and outdoors."},{"startSeconds":23.447,"endSeconds":25.006,"text":"And these do really good for this."},{"startSeconds":25.006,"endSeconds":27.506,"text":"Like again, comfy pace, computational pace."},{"startSeconds":27.506,"endSeconds":28.506,"text":"These are great."},{"startSeconds":28.506,"endSeconds":31.787,"text":"The hardest part is just starting and then the even harder part is getting to that first"},{"startSeconds":31.787,"endSeconds":32.787,"text":"mile."},{"startSeconds":32.787,"endSeconds":33.787,"text":"But once you get there, it's so much easier."},{"startSeconds":33.787,"endSeconds":35.127,"text":"Take it one mile at a time."},{"startSeconds":35.127,"endSeconds":37.627,"text":"Distract yourself because it is truly all mental."},{"startSeconds":37.627,"endSeconds":39.727,"text":"Your mind will tell you to stop bef